{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnFirst":6.2,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":1,"pos":1,"tear":0,"textHomeStatus":"Clear","voice":"vo_char_3056_00_01","textHome":"我的名字是水树垒，@是数千年前引领异世界大战走向@胜利的传说霸王转世。等等，@我受到“那些家伙”的诅咒，@所以不要碰我。除非你想让自己的@存在变成“从未存在过”。@看来“那些家伙”在这个世界也活跃得很。"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.1,"chara":[{"id":305600,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":1.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":305600}]},{"autoTurnFirst":6.6,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":200}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.2,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":0}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":305600}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":1}]}],"group_10":[{"autoTurnFirst":6.4,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":200,"pos":1,"tear":0,"textHomeStatus":"Clear","voice":"vo_char_3056_00_17","textHome":"我变成中二病……@确实是受《终约圣书》影响……@但、但是我一点也不后悔与它相遇。@因为从那以后，每一天都很开心……"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":6.9,"chara":[{"id":305600,"motion":0}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.0,"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":305600}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":305600,"motion":300}]}],"group_11":[{"autoTurnFirst":6.3,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":0,"pos":1,"tear":0,"textHomeStatus":"Clear","voice":"vo_char_3056_00_18","textHome":"大家总拿“中二”攻击《终约圣书》…@…但它明明很厉害。@普通人根本想不出那种设定…@…必须由我来写评论……！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":6.4,"chara":[{"cheek":1,"id":305600,"motion":200}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.5,"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":100}]}],"group_12":[{"autoTurnFirst":3.8,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":100,"pos":1,"tear":0,"textHomeStatus":"Clear","voice":"vo_char_3056_00_19","textHome":"呵呵呵……终于来临了！@大灾变的序幕！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":305600}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"id":305600,"motion":200}]}],"group_13":[{"autoTurnFirst":2.6,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":0,"pos":1,"tear":0,"textHomeStatus":"Clear","voice":"vo_char_3056_00_20","textHome":"我还能变得更强！@绝不会在这里结束！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.5,"chara":[{"id":305600,"motion":100}]}],"group_14":[{"autoTurnFirst":5.8,"chara":[{"cheek":2,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":1,"pos":1,"tear":0,"textHome":"居然能变得这么强，@我也吃了一惊。","voice":"vo_char_3056_00_21"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":305600,"motion":400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":305600}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"id":305600,"motion":200}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"id":305600,"textHomeStatus":"Clear"}]}],"group_15":[{"autoTurnFirst":4.9,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":0,"pos":1,"tear":0,"textHome":"好可怕的力量，@不是中二病是用不了的。","voice":"vo_char_3056_00_22"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.9,"chara":[{"id":305600,"motion":1}]},{"autoTurnFirst":1.3,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.7,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":305600}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"id":305600,"motion":200}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"id":305600,"textHomeStatus":"Clear"}]}],"group_16":[{"autoTurnFirst":3.3,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":1,"pos":1,"tear":0,"textHome":"为了大家，我要努力奋战。","voice":"vo_char_3056_00_23"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.9,"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":305600}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":305600}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.0,"chara":[{"id":305600,"motion":0}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"id":305600,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":1.2,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":305600}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.0,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":305600}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"id":305600,"motion":300}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"id":305600,"textHomeStatus":"Clear"}]}],"group_17":[{"autoTurnFirst":5.7,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":0,"pos":1,"tear":0,"textHomeStatus":"Clear","voice":"vo_char_3056_00_24","textHome":"你是来看我的……？@谢谢。不过我并不是一个人待着就会寂寞，@你不用勉强陪我。"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.7,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":300}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"id":305600,"motion":0}]}],"group_18":[{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":1,"pos":1,"tear":0,"textHome":"黑咖啡……就算早上喝也好苦……","voice":"vo_char_3056_00_25"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":0}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":305600,"motion":200}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"id":305600,"textHomeStatus":"Clear"}]}],"group_19":[{"autoTurnFirst":4.8,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":400,"pos":1,"tear":0,"textHome":"午休时间长得很……睡一会儿吧……","voice":"vo_char_3056_00_26"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":305600}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.3,"chara":[{"id":305600,"motion":1}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.8,"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":305600}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"id":305600,"textHomeStatus":"Clear"}]}],"group_2":[{"autoTurnFirst":2.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":100,"pos":1,"tear":0,"textHomeStatus":"Clear","voice":"vo_char_3056_00_02","textHome":"我是水树垒，别名 Fortress the Wizard——自深渊多@维世界降临的混沌霸王……呵呵，完美…@…哇！？你、你什么时候来的……？"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.5,"chara":[{"id":305600,"motion":1}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.3,"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":305600}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.8,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":200}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.0,"