。只要一动不动就行？@不、不需要摆姿势吧。"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":0}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":1}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"cheek":2,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":300}]}],"group_29":[{"autoTurnFirst":7.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":100,"pos":1,"tear":0,"textHomeStatus":"Clear","voice":"vo_char_3056_00_36","textHome":"这些汉字依次读作Takanashi、@Shinonome、Watanuki。@呃，我也不是特别擅长汉字，@只是刚好知道……"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":1.6,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":0}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.9,"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":300}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":305600}]}],"group_3":[{"autoTurnFirst":3.2,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":300,"pos":1,"tear":0,"textHomeStatus":"Clear","voice":"vo_char_3056_00_03","textHome":"被发现了……完蛋了……今后怎么办……"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":305600}]}],"group_30":[{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"cheek":2,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":300,"pos":1,"tear":0,"textHomeStatus":"Clear","voice":"vo_char_3056_00_37","textHome":"不行了……好难受……这条隐藏路线什么鬼…@…哈，太作弊了……@这么巨大又沉重的感情，到底要怎么压住……"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.2,"chara":[{"id":305600,"motion":0}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":305600,"motion":400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":305600}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.5,"chara":[{"id":305600,"motion":200}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":305600}]}],"group_31":[{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"cheek":2,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":305600,"motion":0,"pos":1,"tear":1,"textHomeStatus":"Clear","voice":"vo_char_3056_00_38","textHome":"呜……呜呜……妈妈……@擅自进了房间……被她看见那个了…@…全完了……呜呜……"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClo